ar:Clause a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf owl:Thing .
ar:Guardrail a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ar:Clause .
ar:ReportContract a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ar:Clause .
ar:JudgementRule a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf owl:Thing .
ar:Task a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf owl:Thing .
ar:ContextSource a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf owl:Thing .
ar:ImplementationPlan a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf owl:Thing .
ar:Report a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf owl:Thing .
ar:Check a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf owl:Thing .
ar:Status a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf owl:Thing .
ar:AcResult a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf owl:Thing .
ar:ChangedFile a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf owl:Thing .
